# Opt-in strict certification contract for the validation-code translator
# (cycle-robustness spec, C0). Loaded only while config/strict_translator.enabled
# exists (toggle with scripts/enable_strict_translator.ps1 /
# disable_strict_translator.ps1), so removing the marker restores the prior
# behaviour without editing .env.
#
# It appends FORMAL_TRANSLATOR_STRICT_ADDENDUM to the translator AND the bounded
# repairer prompts: every logical link must be an executed check, symbol
# relations must be declared so signs are decidable, strict integrals use an
# exhibited point + continuity, no assumed conclusions, and a reachable FAIL
# branch. It does not touch the reviewer, the analyst, or any provider/profile,
# so it COMPOSES with muse_trial / quota_relief (it is not a profile overlay).
ASTRA_TRANSLATOR_STRICT_CONTRACT=1
